@title Copperline Cafe: Quarterly Results
@subtitle Q4 2025 to Q3 2026, for franchise owners (14 locations, all figures in dollars)

data results = quarter,revenue,operating profit; Q4 2025,1842000,243000; Q1 2026,1756000,192000; Q2 2026,1968000,307000; Q3 2026,2134000,375000
data margin = quarter,operating margin; Q4 2025,13.2; Q1 2026,10.9; Q2 2026,15.6; Q3 2026,17.6

# Headline

Q3 2026 was our strongest quarter in the period.

kpi Q3 revenue | $2,134,000 | +8.4% on Q2, +15.9% on Q4 2025 | good
kpi Q3 operating profit | $375,000 | 17.6% margin | good

Trailing four quarters:

kpi Revenue | $7,700,000 | trailing four quarters | neutral
kpi Operating profit | $1,117,000 | trailing four quarters | neutral
kpi Margin | 14.5% | trailing four quarters | neutral

# Quarterly results

table = quarter,revenue,cost of goods,labor,rent and other,operating profit,margin; Q4 2025,"$1,842,000","$589,000","$612,000","$398,000","$243,000",13.2%; Q1 2026,"$1,756,000","$561,000","$598,000","$405,000","$192,000",10.9%; Q2 2026,"$1,968,000","$618,000","$631,000","$412,000","$307,000",15.6%; Q3 2026,"$2,134,000","$662,000","$676,000","$421,000","$375,000",17.6%; Trailing four quarters,"$7,700,000",,,,"$1,117,000",14.5%

chart bar results y=revenue,operating profit unit=$ title="Revenue and operating profit by quarter"

# Margin trend

Operating margin fell to 10.9% in Q1, then climbed two quarters in a row to 17.6% in Q3.

chart line margin unit=% labels title="Operating margin"

# Notes

- Q1 is the seasonal low.
- Two new locations opened on 2026-05-18, which explains part of the Q2 and Q3 growth.
- The Q3 figures are unaudited.
